    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy Policy</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">PantryPal stores your pantry, grocery list and recipes only on your device. We do not create accounts, and we do not upload your food data to any server.\n\nThe app shows banner ads provided by Google AdMob. AdMob may collect device identifiers and usage data to serve ads. Where required by law, you are asked for consent before ads are personalized.\n\nNotifications are generated locally on your phone to remind you about food that is about to expire. You can turn them off at any time in your system settings.\n\nUninstalling the app removes all data stored by PantryPal.</string>

